title: "Little Lemon Database — Meta Database Engineer Capstone"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-25"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/malikb0/meta-database-engineer-capstone"
authors:
  - family-names: "Malik"
    given-names: "Awais"
abstract: >-
  An end-to-end relational database project for a restaurant ("Little Lemon"):
  a normalised MySQL 8 schema modelled in MySQL Workbench, analytical SQL with
  views, joins, subqueries, stored procedures and transactions, an interactive
  Tableau dashboard, and a Python client using mysql-connector-python.
keywords:
  - MySQL
  - SQL
  - database design
  - Tableau
  - Python
references:
  - type: software
    title: "Meta Database Engineer Professional Certificate"
    publisher:
      name: "Coursera / Meta Platforms, Inc."
    url: "https://www.coursera.org/professional-certificates/meta-database-engineer"
    notes: >-
      The course that inspired this independent implementation. No course
      material is included in this repository.
